hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2929","###\n Narrated to us Muhammad bin Bashshar, who said: Narrated to us Abd al-Wahhab, meaning al-Thaqafi, who said: Narrated to us Ubaydullah, from Nafi', from Ibn Umar (RA), from the Prophet (ﷺ), who said: \"O Allah, forgive those who shave their heads.\" The Companions said, \"And those who trim their hair?\" He said, \"O Allah, forgive those who shave their heads.\" They said again, \"And those who trim their hair?\" He repeated this"
